Reusable OpenSCAD helper modules by the author of reprap-household-misc. The
single lib.scad is vendored verbatim inside a lumpyscad/ directory, because the
models that include it address it as `<lumpyscad/lib.scad>`, exactly the layout
upstream expects. The upstream README is not vendored.

